es":"ml-section-head ml-reveal","_title":"Section heading"},"elements":[{"id":"a24bbd","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"🧑‍🏫 エキスパートの力で世界的な成功をサポート","header_size":"h2","align":"center","_title":"Heading","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"a26aac","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>MacroLingoは、複雑なアイデアをシンプルに伝え、国際的なコミュニケーションをスムーズにし、ビジネスや組織の成功をサポートしています。私たちは、専門家の豊富な知識と経験を活かして、その使命を遂行してきました。各分野の専門家を採用し、その専門性を最大限に活用して、お客様に最適なソリューションを提供します。15年以上の実績が、その信頼性を証明しています。</p>","align":"center","_css_classes":"ml-lead","_title":"Intro","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a2a88a","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"row","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"22","column":"22","row":"22","isLinked":true},"flex_wrap":"wrap","width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"flex_align_items":"stretch","css_classes":"ml-three-up","_title":"The three values"},"elements":[{"id":"a13556","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"32","right":"32","bottom":"32","left":"32","isLinked":false},"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-card ml-value-card ml-reveal","_title":"エキスパート主導"},"elements":[{"id":"a0d889","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"id":1467,"url":"https://staging1.macrolingo.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/head-book.jpg","alt":"エキスパート主導","source":"library","size":""},"image_size":"full","_css_classes":"ml-value-mark","_title":"Mark"},"elements":[]},{"id":"a0f778","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"エキスパート主導","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"ml-value-title","_title":"Title","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"a11667","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>高度なトピックには専門的な知識が欠かせません。私たちはすべてのメンバーが専門家であり、一般的な翻訳者やライターでは対応できないテーマもお任せいただけます。</p>","_css_classes":"ml-value-text","_title":"Words"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a1b112","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"32","right":"32","bottom":"32","left":"32","isLinked":false},"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-card ml-value-card ml-reveal ml-reveal-1","_title":"グローバルなオーディエンスに対応"},"elements":[{"id":"a15445","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"id":1469,"url":"https://staging1.macrolingo.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/head-earth.jpg","alt":"グローバルなオーディエンスに対応","source":"library","size":""},"image_size":"full","_css_classes":"ml-value-mark","_title":"Mark"},"elements":[]},{"id":"a17334","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"グローバルなオーディエンスに対応","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"ml-value-title","_title":"Title","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"a19223","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>英語は世界中のコミュニケーションの共通言語であり、様々なレベルでの明確なコミュニケーションが求められます。私たちは、理解しやすく、かつ共感を呼ぶコンテンツ制作に力を入れています。</p>","_css_classes":"ml-value-text","_title":"Words"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a22cce","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"32","right":"32","bottom":"32","left":"32","isLinked":false},"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-card ml-value-card ml-reveal ml-reveal-2","_title":"エコフレンドリー"},"elements":[{"id":"a1d001","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"id":1466,"url":"https://staging1.macrolingo.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/head-sustainable.jpg","alt":"エコフレンドリー","source":"library","size":""},"image_size":"full","_css_classes":"ml-value-mark","_title":"Mark"},"elements":[]},{"id":"a1eef0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"エコフレンドリー","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"ml-value-title","_title":"Title","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"a20ddf","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>地球には限られた時間しか存在できません。だからこそ、MacroLingoはサステナブルな社会の実現に向けて、地球に優しいクライアントとのみお仕事をさせていただいています。</p>","_css_classes":"ml-value-text","_title":"Words"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"a36224","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_align_items":"center","_element_id":"japan","css_classes":"ml-jp ml-band-grey","_title":"Made in Japan"},"elements":[{"id":"a32446","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"34","left":"0","isLinked":false},"css_classes":"ml-section-head ml-reveal","_title":"Heading"},"elements":[{"id":"a2e668","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"🇯🇵 日本と西洋のベストを融合した 🇺🇸🇦🇺","header_size":"h2","align":"center","_title":"Heading","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"a30557","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"日本の仕事の美学に国際的な視点を加えたアプローチ","header_size":"h4","align":"center","_css_classes":"ml-japan-sub","_title":"Subheading"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a34335","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>MacroLingo（旧Scize Group）は、福岡で設立され、大阪に拠点を移しました。アメリカンな顔を持ちながらも、20年にわたる日本の企業および学術界で培った豊富な経験があります。私たちは日本の仕事観を尊重し、お客様は神様であり、細部にまで注意深く耳を傾け、全体を把握します。年功序列や専門性を重んじ、試行錯誤を繰り返しながら、品質を徹底的に追求します。たとえ基本的な業務であっても、自分たちの仕事に誇りを持ち、常に改善を図ります。これらの仕事観は、どの国のクライアントにも通づる基本です。それと同時に、アメリカンな情熱、競争心、迅速な実行力に加え、少しのオーストラリアンな親しみやすさと楽しさを大切にしています。日本と西洋の良さを融合させ、世界中の皆さまに最高のサービスをお届けします。</p>","_css_classes":"ml-prose ml-reveal ml-reveal-1","_title":"The passage","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a4599c","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"_element_id":"adam","css_classes":"ml-jp ml-band-blue ml-split-adam","_title":"Adam"},"elements":[{"id":"a3bef1","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"18","column":"18","row":"18","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-adam-photo ml-reveal","_title":"Adam photo"},"elements":[{"id":"a38113","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"id":2268,"url":"https://staging1.macrolingo.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Adam-Scize.jpg","alt":"Dr. Adam Goulston","source":"library","size":""},"image_size":"full","_css_classes":"ml-photo ml-photo-square","_title":"Adam"},"elements":[]},{"id":"a3a002","elType":"widget","widgetType":"image","settings":{"image":{"id":2270,"url":"https://staging1.macrolingo.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/BELS.png","alt":"Board-certified Editor in the Life Sciences","source":"library","size":""},"image_size":"full","_css_classes":"ml-bels","_title":"BELS badge"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a43aad","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"_title":"Adam words","css_classes":"ml-reveal ml-reveal-1"},"elements":[{"id":"a3dde0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"皆様の国際的なビジネスの挑戦に寄り添い、全力でサポートします。","header_size":"h2","_css_classes":"ml-heading-about","_title":"Heading","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"a3fccf","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>私がこの会社を立ち上げた理由は、一般的なエージェンシーでは扱いきれない難しいトピックや、グローバルなオーディエンスに応える必要性を感じたからです。私たちは、そのようなニーズに最適に応えるパートナーです。アメリカで生まれ育ち、成人後は主にアジアでの生活を通じて、外国語の習得やジャーナリズム、リサーチにおける独自のマインドセットを身につけてきました。私自身の能力と、グローバルな経験を持つ仲間たちと共に、皆さまに最高のサービスを提供いたします。</p>","_css_classes":"ml-bio-wide","_title":"What Adam says","__globals__":{"text_color":"globals/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"a41bbe","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>アダム</p>","_css_classes":"ml-signature","_title":"Signature"},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"a60aae","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_align_items":"stretch","_element_id":"owner","css_classes":"ml-jp","_title":"Owner"},"elements":[{"id":"a4b669","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"34","left":"0","isLinked":false},"css_classes":"ml-section-head ml-reveal","_title":"Section heading"},"elements":[{"id":"a4788b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"オーナー","header_size":"h6","align":"center","_css_classes":"ml-label ml-label-centred","_title":"Label"},"elements":[]},{"id":"a4977a","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Dr. Adam Goulston（アダム・グールストン）博士","header_size":"h2","align":"center","_title":"Heading","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"a5ebbf","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","t